                    <h2 class="cv-headline" id="seeking-heading">Work where technology <em>meets</em><br />
                        <span class="cv-turn" aria-hidden="true"><em class="on">people.</em><em>psychology.</em><em>business.</em><em>storytelling.</em><em>culture.</em></span><span class="cv-sr">people, psychology, business, storytelling and culture.</span></h2>
